++N_i = perp_initial_notional_i = q_i,0 * F_i,0
++perp_initial_margin_i = N_i
++
++q_spot_i,0 = +q_i,0
++q_perp_i,0 = -q_i,0
++```
++
++因此：
++
++```text
++spot_principal_i + perp_initial_margin_i = pair_budget_i
++q_spot_i,0 + q_perp_i,0 = 0
++```
++
++`N_i` 是该品种初始短永续名义及后续 100% 状态的名义基准，不是额外资本项。
